# Citation Analysis: A Case Study of Korean Scientists and Engineers in Electrical and Electronics Engineering.

**Authors:** Rieh, Hae-young

## Abstract
Describes a study that investigated the citation patterns of publications by scientists and engineers in electrical and electronics engineering in Korea. Citation behavior of personnel in government, universities, and industry is compared; and citation patterns from articles in Korean and non-Korean publications are contrasted. (Contains 27 references.) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ473021

